    "preamble": "Amitabh Singh vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 2 March, 2023 Author: Surya Prakash Kesarwani Bench: Surya Prakash Kesarwani High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Court No. - 3 Case :- Writ - C No. - 1846 of 2023 Petitioner :- Amitabh Singh Respondent :- State Of U.P. And 2 Others Counsel for Petitioner :- Rahul Pandey,Rang Nath Pandey",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "The matter shall not be treated as part heard or tied up the Bench.\" Today, learned Standing Counsel states on instruction of respondent No.2 that against the impugned orders, an appeal lies before the Tribunal, under Section 70(1) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 and therefore, the petitioner may prefer an appeal before the tribunal.",
